<title>UK: Skandia unit sets $100 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Skandia unit sets $100 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SKANDIA CAPITAL AB</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  SKANDIA INSURANCE COMPANY LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    04.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.722    PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    99.722    SPREAD	+50 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA1	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.25 JAN 2002 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
